# CMMS Project - Claude Code Auto Mode Configuration

## Project Overview
This is a **Computerized Maintenance Management System (CMMS)** - a complete web-based maintenance management application with real-time OPC UA connectivity for industrial asset monitoring.

**Tech Stack:**
- Backend: Node.js + Express + SQLite
- Frontend: React + Vite + Tailwind CSS
- OPC Service: Python with node7 (S7 PLC connectivity)
- Deployment: Docker + Docker Compose
- Platform: Windows with Git Bash

