## Key Capabilities
1. **Asset Management** - Equipment tracking, criticality, locations
2. **Work Order Management** - Create, assign, track maintenance tasks
3. **Preventive Maintenance** - Schedule recurring PM with 52-week calendar
4. **OPC UA Connectivity** - Real-time PLC integration (Siemens S7, AB, Schneider, etc.)
5. **Real-Time Monitoring** - Live asset status from industrial equipment
6. **Inventory Management** - Parts, stock levels, suppliers
7. **Leave Management** - Employee leave requests
8. **User Management** - Role-based access control (Admin, Maintenance, Viewer)
9. **Reporting** - Work orders, PM compliance, inventory, downtime

