## Special Considerations

### Windows Environment
- Use Git Bash for shell commands
- Handle Windows paths correctly (C:\Users\...)
- Use dos2unix for line ending issues
- PowerShell commands when needed

### Database Migrations
- Always use proper migration files
- Never modify database schema directly
- Create migration: backend/migrations/YYYYMMDD_description.sql
- Apply via backend startup or manual sqlite3

### OPC Connectivity
- S7 PLCs use Snap7 library
- Connection format: IP:Rack:Slot (e.g., 192.168.1.10:0:1)
- Tag format: Area.Start.Bit (e.g., DB1.0.0)
- Network mode: host (for PLC access)

### Theme System
- 5 themes supported: light, dark, blue, green, purple
- Theme stored in localStorage
- CSS variables for theming
- Fully responsive for mobile/tablet/desktop

